== Effects ==
* Upon use, copies the effect of the [[pill]] currently held by Isaac.
* {{dlc+|r}} Placebo's recharge time changes upon use, depending on the pill Isaac was holding when he used it. {{dlc-}}

== Notes ==
* {{Dlc|r}} The item only costs 10 coins when found in a {{r|Shop}}.
* Unknown pills are identified when copied.
* Has no effect when used without a pill.

